    <p class="ar-pol__glance-title">What we collect</p>
    <p>Contact, order, account, device/usage, support messages, and marketing preferences you choose to share.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="ar-pol__glance-card">
    <p class="ar-pol__glance-title">Why we use it</p>
    <p>To fulfil orders, run the storefront, prevent fraud, provide support, improve the site, and send marketing only where allowed.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="ar-pol__glance-card">
    <p class="ar-pol__glance-title">Who helps us</p>
    <p>Shopify and specialised providers for payments, logistics, reviews, analytics, affiliate tracking, and related store operations.</p>
  </article>
  <article class="ar-pol__glance-card">
    <p class="ar-pol__glance-title">Your choices</p>
    <p>Contact us to ask questions, request access/correction/deletion where applicable, withdraw consent, or raise a complaint.</p>
  </article>
