<div class="ar-pol__content">
  <p class="ar-pol__updated ar-pol-reveal"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 24 August 2026</p>

  <section id="ar-prv-who" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-who">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-who" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">1.</span> Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      This Privacy Notice explains how <strong>Anand Rasa</strong> (“we”, “us”) collects and uses personal information
      when you visit <a href="{{ shop.url }}">{{ shop.domain }}</a>, create an account, place an order, contact support,
      or otherwise use our online services.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Trade name:</strong> Anand Rasa<br>
      <strong>Registered address:</strong> {{ ar_address | escape }}<br>
      <strong>Privacy / grievance contact:</strong>
      <a href="mailto:{{ ar_email | escape }}">{{ ar_email | escape }}</a>
    </p>
    <p>
      Our storefront is powered by <strong>Shopify</strong>. Shopify processes certain information on our behalf so we can operate the online store, checkout, and related services.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-scope" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-scope">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-scope" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">2.</span> Scope</h2>
    <p>
      This notice applies to personal information processed in connection with our website, online sales in India,
      customer support, and related digital marketing for Anand Rasa.
      It does not cover websites or apps we do not control.
    </p>
    <p>
      We aim to describe our practices in plain language consistent with India’s Digital Personal Data Protection framework
      (including the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and related Rules, as and when applicable).
      This notice is informational and is not a certification of legal compliance.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-collect" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-collect">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-collect" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">3.</span> Personal information we collect</h2>
    <p>Depending on how you use the store, we may process:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Identity and contact details</strong> — name, email, phone number, billing and shipping address.</li>
      <li><strong>Order and transaction details</strong> — products viewed or purchased, cart contents, order history, payment status, and fulfilment information.</li>
      <li><strong>Payment-related information</strong> — payment confirmation and limited transaction metadata. Card payments are processed by Shopify and/or payment providers. Anand Rasa does not store your full payment card number on our own systems.</li>
      <li><strong>Account information</strong> — if you create a customer account (for example login credentials and account preferences).</li>
      <li><strong>Support communications</strong> — messages you send via contact forms, email, phone, or WhatsApp.</li>
      <li><strong>Device and usage data</strong> — IP address, browser/device type, pages visited, referring URLs, and similar technical logs.</li>
      <li><strong>Reviews and user content</strong> — if you submit product reviews or related media through review tools.</li>
      <li><strong>Marketing preferences</strong> — for example newsletter or offer preferences where you provide them.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-sources" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-sources">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-sources" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">4.</span> Sources of information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Directly from you</strong> — checkout, account registration, contact forms, support channels, reviews, and marketing sign-ups.</li>
      <li><strong>Automatically</strong> — cookies, pixels, and similar technologies when you browse or use the store.</li>
      <li><strong>Service providers</strong> — Shopify and other processors that help us operate payments, logistics, reviews, analytics, affiliate tracking, and related functions.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-purposes" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-purposes">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-purposes" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">5.</span> Purposes of processing</h2>
    <div class="ar-pol__table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Data purpose overview" tabindex="0">
      <table class="ar-pol__table">
        <caption class="visually-hidden">Personal data categories, purposes, and processing reasons</caption>
