  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-consent" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-consent">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-consent" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">6.</span> Consent and withdrawal</h2>
    <p>
      Where we rely on consent (for example certain marketing communications or non-essential cookies/pixels, depending on settings and applicable law),
      you may withdraw consent at any time without affecting processing already completed lawfully.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Use unsubscribe links in marketing emails where provided.</li>
      <li>Adjust cookie/consent preferences where a consent banner or Shopify customer privacy tools are presented.</li>
      <li>Email <a href="mailto:{{ ar_email | escape }}">{{ ar_email | escape }}</a> to withdraw consent or update preferences.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-cookies" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-cookies">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-cookies" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">7.</span> Cookies and tracking technologies</h2>
    <p>
      We use cookies, pixels, and similar technologies. Categories that may be used on this storefront include:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Essential / Shopify</strong> — session, cart, checkout, security, and store operation.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics</strong> — Google Tag Manager (<code>GTM-NFQL546M</code>) and related measurement tags configured through it; plus the theme’s <code>spf-analytics</code> script.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising / remarketing</strong> — may be delivered via GTM or advertising platforms connected to the store. Exact ads tags active inside GTM should be confirmed in your GTM container.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate tracking</strong> — GoAffPro affiliate pixel (where installed).</li>
      <li><strong>Reviews</strong> — Judge.me and Loox review tools (product reviews and related widgets).</li>
      <li><strong>Checkout / logistics tooling</strong> — Shiprocket / Pickrr related checkout scripts where enabled on the storefront.</li>
      <li><strong>Marketing popups</strong> — on-site promotional messaging that may record marketing consent preferences.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      You can control cookies through your browser settings. Blocking essential cookies may affect cart and checkout functionality.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-sharing" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-sharing">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-sharing" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">8.</span> Sharing and disclosure</h2>
    <p>We share personal information only as needed to operate the store, including with:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Shopify</strong> — ecommerce platform, hosting of storefront/checkout, and related processing.</li>
      <li><strong>Payment providers</strong> — to process prepaid payments securely.</li>
      <li><strong>Logistics / courier partners</strong> — to deliver orders and provide tracking.</li>
      <li><strong>Support and operations tools</strong> — to respond to customer messages.</li>
      <li><strong>Review platforms</strong> — Judge.me and Loox when you submit or view reviews.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics and marketing tools</strong> — such as Google Tag Manager and tags configured within it.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate partners</strong> — GoAffPro for referral attribution where applicable.</li>
      <li><strong>Legal or safety disclosures</strong> — when required by law, or to protect rights, safety, and security.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell your personal information as a product.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-shopify" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-shopify">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-shopify" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">9.</span> Shopify and service providers</h2>
    <p>
      Shopify and other service providers process personal information under arrangements that support store operations.
      Their own privacy notices also apply to processing they control as platforms or independent services.
      You can review Shopify’s privacy materials on Shopify’s website.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-ads" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-ads">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-ads" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">10.</span> Advertising, analytics, and remarketing</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google Tag Manager and may use analytics/advertising tags to measure visits, understand product interest,
      and measure or deliver marketing. Affiliate tracking (GoAffPro) may attribute referred purchases.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Business verification needed:</strong> confirm which advertising pixels (for example Meta, Google Ads) are currently live inside GTM and any Shopify app pixels, and keep this section aligned with that list.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-international" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-international">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-international" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">11.</span> International processing</h2>
    <p>
      Because we use Shopify and global service providers, personal information may be processed on servers located outside India.
      Those providers apply their own security and contractual safeguards.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Legal verification needed:</strong> if you rely on specific cross-border transfer documentation beyond provider terms, have counsel confirm the wording before adding stronger transfer claims.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-retention" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-retention">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-retention" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">12.</span> Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      We keep personal information only as long as reasonably needed for the purposes described above —
      including order fulfilment, accounting, dispute handling, security, and legal requirements — and then delete or de-identify it where practicable.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong>Business/legal verification needed:</strong> set and publish specific retention periods by record type (orders, support tickets, marketing lists) if your counsel recommends fixed timelines.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-security" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-security">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-security" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">13.</span> Security</h2>
    <p>
      We use commercially reasonable administrative and technical measures, and rely on Shopify’s platform security for storefront and checkout.
      No method of transmission or storage is completely secure. Please protect your account credentials and contact us if you suspect unauthorised access.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-rights" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-rights">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-rights" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">14.</span> Privacy rights</h2>
    <p>
      Subject to applicable Indian law (including the Digital Personal Data Protection framework as it applies to you),
      you may have rights to request access to, correction of, or erasure of personal data, and to withdraw consent for consent-based processing.
    </p>
    <p>
      We do not automatically extend GDPR “EEA/UK” rights to every visitor.
      If you are located in a jurisdiction with additional mandatory rights, tell us where you live when you contact us so we can respond appropriately.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-requests" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-requests">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-requests" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">15.</span> Privacy requests and complaints</h2>
    <div class="ar-pol__cards" role="list">
      <div class="ar-pol__card" role="listitem">
        <span class="ar-pol__card-label">Privacy questions</span>
        <a class="ar-pol__card-value" href="mailto:{{ ar_email | escape }}">{{ ar_email | escape }}</a>
      </div>
      <div class="ar-pol__card" role="listitem">
        <span class="ar-pol__card-label">Data requests</span>
        <a class="ar-pol__card-value" href="{{ ar_contact_url }}">Submit via Contact</a>
      </div>
      <div class="ar-pol__card" role="listitem">
        <span class="ar-pol__card-label">Marketing preferences</span>
        <a class="ar-pol__card-value" href="mailto:{{ ar_email | escape }}?subject=Marketing%20preferences">Email preferences</a>
      </div>
      <div class="ar-pol__card" role="listitem">
        <span class="ar-pol__card-label">Complaints / grievance</span>
        <a class="ar-pol__card-value" href="mailto:{{ ar_email | escape }}?subject=Privacy%20complaint">{{ ar_email | escape }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p>
      Please include enough detail for us to verify and respond (for example order number or account email).
      You may also contact us by phone at
      <a href="tel:{{ ar_phone_href | replace: ' ', '' | escape }}">{{ ar_phone_display | escape }}</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-children" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-children">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-children" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">16.</span> Children’s data</h2>
    <p>
      Our store is intended for adults.
      We do not knowingly sell products to children or collect personal data from children for marketing.
      If you believe a child has provided personal information, contact us and we will take appropriate steps to delete it where required.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-changes" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-changes">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-changes" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">17.</span> Changes to this notice</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Notice from time to time.
      The “Last updated” date at the top will change when we publish revisions.
      Continued use of the website after an update means you should review the revised notice.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="ar-prv-contact" class="ar-pol__block ar-pol-reveal" aria-labelledby="ar-prv-h-contact">
    <h2 id="ar-prv-h-contact" class="ar-pol__h2"><span class="ar-pol__num" aria-hidden="true">18.</span> Contact information</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>Anand Rasa</strong><br>
      {{ ar_address | escape }}<br>
      Email: <a href="mailto:{{ ar_email | escape }}">{{ ar_email | escape }}</a><br>
      Phone: <a href="tel:{{ ar_phone_href | replace: ' ', '' | escape }}">{{ ar_phone_display | escape }}</a><br>
      Contact form: <a href="{{ ar_contact_url }}">{{ ar_contact_url }}</a>
    </p>
  </section>

  <nav class="ar-pol__related ar-pol-reveal" aria-label="Related policies">
    <h2 class="ar-pol__h2">Related policies</h2>
    <ul class="ar-pol__related-list" role="list">
